{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": "ἄσμενος, η, ον, well-pleased, glad, always with a Verb, φύγεν ἄ. ἐκ θανάτοιο he was glad to have escaped death,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 20.350", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 9.63", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pi. O. 13.74", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": freq. in Trag. and ,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄσμενος δὲ τἂν . . κάμψειεν γόνυ A. Pr. 398", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκ θαλάσσης ἀσμένους πεφευγότας E. Hel. 398", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "014", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄ. αἱρεθείς Th. 6.12", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκάθευδον ἄ. ἥκων ἐξ ἀγροῦ Lys. 1.13", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀσμένας εἰς τὸν λειμῶνα ἀπιούσας Pl. R. 614e", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": freq. in dat., ἐμοὶ δέ κεν ἀσμένῳ εἴη glad would it make me !"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 14.108", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀσμένῳ δέ σοι . . νὺξ ἀποκρύψει φάος glad wilt thou be when night shuts out the light,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "A. Pr. 23", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὥς σφι ἀσμένοισι ἡμέρα ἐπέλαμψε Hdt. 8.14", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀσμένῃ δέ μοι . . ἦλθε S. Tr. 18", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὡς ἀσμένοισιν ἦλθες Ar. Pax 582", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Cra. 418c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. Adv."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀσμένως gladly, readily, A. Pr. 728", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 18.36", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Alex. 142", "author_abbreviation": "Alex.", "tlg_author": "0402", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Timocl. 14", "author_abbreviation": "Timocl.", "tlg_author": "0515", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(this Adv., which is common in later Greek,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Act.Ap. 21.17", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0031", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc., has sts. been substituted for the Adj., as in"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 4.21", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(v. l.)): Sup. ἀσμεναίτατα ( v.l. -έστατα )"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 329c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; -έστατα ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "616a", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(though the Adj. makes -ώτερος, -ώτατος,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hp. Art. 8", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": "0627", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Phryn. PS p.18B.", "author_abbreviation": "Phryn.", "tlg_author": "1608", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "). (Not to be connected with ἁνδάνω, since there is no ancient authority for rough breathing ἁσμ-.)"}]}